{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dive into a surreal speed-fishing odyssey that defies reality. In this unique blend of high-speed boating and unconventional fishing mechanics, you'll harness the power of fish to propel your vessel through dreamlike waters.\u200b</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641250/extras/9792e2b70799011768076c49f34c13b1.avif?t=1763891459\" width=650 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641250/extras/319b8b8bc7c807f35832e96f24a5b7e4.poster.avif?t=1763891459\" width=800 height=454 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641250/extras/319b8b8bc7c807f35832e96f24a5b7e4.webm?t=1763891459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641250/extras/319b8b8bc7c807f35832e96f24a5b7e4.mp4?t=1763891459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast your rod to catch a powerful fish that will pull your boat, becoming a <i>fish-engine</i>, control the direction by pulling the fishing rod into desired direction and hope that the fish won't outpower you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641250/extras/b5f1e06580a07e8b836bbb603927063f.avif?t=1763891459\" width=650 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641250/extras/f636c6138b82326f6df301cbe894dde1.poster.avif?t=1763891459\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641250/extras/f636c6138b82326f6df301cbe894dde1.webm?t=1763891459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641250/extras/f636c6138b82326f6df301cbe894dde1.mp4?t=1763891459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These waters are filled with a bunch of weird creatures that behave like fish. Why are they like this? What purpose do they serve? All that bothers you is that they act like fish and react to bait like fish, so that means you MUST catch them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641250/extras/ab407659f1d6fe822feaf8aac6f78670.avif?t=1763891459\" width=650 height=86 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641250/extras/1eff0f4d1b710f55a04c771700b5d234.poster.avif?t=1763891459\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641250/extras/1eff0f4d1b710f55a04c771700b5d234.webm?t=1763891459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3641250/extras/1eff0f4d1b710f55a04c771700b5d234.mp4?t=1763891459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Two hands means two fishing rods - while controlling the boat with one rod, you can cast with a second one to catch fish that tags alongside and increase your total haul.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3641250?t=1763891459","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3641250?t=1763891459","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/